  "description": "TS/Vue companion to qwen-assemble-new-file, scoped to new Options-API Pinia stores: generates each action independently via local qwen2.5-coder:7b (NVIDIA fallback), assembles into actions:{}, syntax-checks via TypeScript compiler API, writes via docker-b",
